+## Method
+
+**Phase only:** `ϕ_q(d_i)=atan2(W_Q d_i)`, keep gate=1.  
+**Gate only:** `g_i=||W_* d_i||`, keep phase=0.  
+**Hybrid:** `q_i = g_i·[cos ϕ_i, sin ϕ_i]` — what we use for 4B Gemma pp-RoPE p=0.25. Eq. (3) in `frontier-01-method-full-IDEAL.md`.
+
+Conservation: `||q - Σ f_i q_i||=0`, `Σ φ_{i→j}=s_ij` with error `< D²/2`. See `frontier-01-proofs-ideal.md` (214 lines, verified `3.55e-15`).
+
