-Point on circle radius 1: exp(iD)=cosD + i sinD. (1,0) rotated D=5°=0.087 rad => (cos5°, sin5°)=(0.996,0.087) ~= (1,0.087)=1+iD error D^2/2=0.0038. At D=90°=1.57 rad (0,1) vs (1,1.57) error 1 FAIL where RoPE breaks 8192. Fig2.
