-Soundness 1-4, Presentation 1-4, Contribution 1-4, Overall 1-10 (1,3,5,6,8,10), Confidence 1-5. Low-rated criticized unclear writing, weak baselines, limited datasets, unclear algorithmic description, high-rated recognized novelty, methodological soundness, efficient model, clear presentation.
